      "text": [
        "4691 - وَ رُوِيَ: \"أَنَّ مَنْ مَاتَ بِلاَ خَلَفٍ فَكَأَنْ لَمْ يَكُنْ فِي اَلنَّاسِ وَ مَنْ مَاتَ وَ لَهُ خَلَفٌ فَكَأَنْ لَمْ يَمُتْ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4691 - It is narrated:\n\"Whoever dies without leaving behind a successor, it is as if he was never among the people. And whoever dies and leaves behind a successor, it is as if he never died.\""
        ]
      }
